id: bio-focus
name: Bio-Focus
# A Racial Factor: what it asks for, shown beside its Factor Traits and never enforced (the user's). Its Factor Traits - Genetic Focus, one
# for each race, all replacing Uncanny Monster - are the files in the folder of its name.
requirement: Bio-Android
maximumFactor: 1
prerequisites: Genetic Splicing Factor
description: >
  Though you were artificially created from the genetics of many other species, you most closely resemble one of those species, and might even be able to reasonably pass for a member of that race at a glance.
